      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Can I stay here for a little while longer?\r\nI'm enjoying the time I get to spend with the\r\ncaptain, it's like a dream— If it's a dream like\r\nthis, I'd like to watch it a little longer!",
